The GGUF operations, dequantization, tensor remapping, tokenizer reconstruction
and patcher in extern/gguf derive from ComfyUI-GGUF, copied from the vendored
adapter in ComfyUI_SmartModelLoader_Nova (837a9f085fb7103ec036c4822397b2506328735b).
Original source notices are retained. SmartLLM Nova modifies the adapter for
native text generation: no node/folder registration or diffusion loaders,
explicit projector selection, Gemma3 vision mapping, output-head handling,
local logging and exception-safe patcher cloning. This is an independent copy.
